Typical placement:

| Zone                       | Role                               |
| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| **Core Zone (Kubernetes)** | Gravitee Gateway (runtime traffic) |
| Secure / App Zones         | Backend services                   |
| Management Zone            | Gravitee UI, Management API        |
| IAM Zone                   | OAuth / Identity Provider          |

➡️ All API traffic **must pass through the Gateway**, not directly to services.

